<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Patologi Anatomi Sistem Digestif</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Libre+Baskerville:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #f6f4ef;
  --card: #ffffff;
  --border: #e6e0d4;

  --rose:   #d4768a;
  --rose-l: #faeef1;
  --rose-d: #a04060;

  --amber:  #d4a040;
  --amber-l:#fdf6e3;
  --amber-d:#8a6010;

  --teal:   #4a9e90;
  --teal-l: #eaf6f4;
  --teal-d: #2a6e62;

  --indigo: #6878c0;
  --indigo-l:#eef0fa;
  --indigo-d:#3848a0;

  --sage:   #7aaa72;
  --sage-l: #eef6ec;
  --sage-d: #3a6a34;

  --plum:   #9070b8;
  --plum-l: #f4f0fa;
  --plum-d: #5030a0;

  --coral:  #d87860;
  --coral-l:#fdf0ec;
  --coral-d:#a04020;

  --ink: #1c1e2a;
  --mid: #485068;
  --muted: #8890aa;

  --danger: #c83030;
}

*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

body{
  font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--ink);
  line-height:1.75;
}

/* ── HERO ── */
.hero{
  min-height:340px;
  background:var(--ink);
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  text-align:center;
  padding:80px 40px 64px;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-rings{
  position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle 300px at 20% 50%, rgba(74,158,144,.15) 0%,transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(circle 400px at 80% 30%, rgba(104,120,192,.12) 0%,transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(circle 200px at 50% 90%, rgba(212,118,138,.1) 0%,transparent 60%);
}
.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;}
.hero-kicker{
  display:inline-block;
  font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--teal);border:1.5px solid var(--teal);
  padding:5px 18px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:20px;
}
.hero h1{
  font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;
  font-size:clamp(30px,6vw,58px);font-weight:700;
  color:white;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:14px;
}
.hero h1 em{color:var(--amber);font-style:normal;}
.hero p{font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin-bottom:30px;}
.hero-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;}
.chip{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;
  padding:7px 16px;border-radius:20px;
  transition:all .2s;
}
.chip:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);}

/* ── NAV ── */
.topnav{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
  background:rgba(246,244,239,.95);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--border);
  display:flex;overflow-x:auto;gap:0;padding:0 28px;
}
.topnav a{
  padding:14px 16px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;
  color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;
  border-bottom:2.5px solid transparent;transition:all .2s;
  letter-spacing:.3px;
}
.topnav a:hover{color:var(--teal-d);border-color:var(--teal);}

/* ── LAYOUT ── */
.wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px 32px;}
section{margin-bottom:80px;}

.sec-head{
  display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;
  margin-bottom:30px;padding-bottom:16px;
  border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);
}
.sec-num{
  font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;
  font-size:44px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;
  color:var(--border);flex-shrink:0;
  margin-top:2px;
}
.sec-info h2{
  font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;
  font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;
}
.sec-info p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;letter-spacing:.3px;}

/* ── CARDS ── */
.card{
  background:var(--card);border:1.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:18px;padding:22px 26px;margin-bottom:14px;
}
.card h3{
  font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;
  font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;
}
.card p,.card li{font-size:14px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.8;}
.card ul{padding-left:20px;}
.card li{margin-bottom:5px;}

.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px;}
.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:12px;}

/* color cards */
.cr{background:var(--rose-l);border-color:#eac0c8;}
.ca{background:var(--amber-l);border-color:#e8d098;}
.ct{background:var(--teal-l);border-color:#a8d8d0;}
.ci{background:var(--indigo-l);border-color:#b8c0e0;}
.cs{background:var(--sage-l);border-color:#b0d8a8;}
.cp{background:var(--plum-l);border-color:#c8b8e0;}
.cc{background:var(--coral-l);border-color:#e8b8a8;}

/* ── ALERT ── */
.alert{
  border-left:4px solid;border-radius:0 14px 14px 0;
  padding:15px 20px;margin:14px 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--mid);
}
.alert strong{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:5px;}
.alert.danger{background:#fff2f2;border-color:var(--danger);}
.alert.danger strong{color:var(--danger);}
.alert.warn{background:var(--amber-l);border-color:var(--amber);}
.alert.warn strong{color:var(--amber-d);}
.alert.info{background:var(--teal-l);border-color:var(--teal);}
.alert.info strong{color:var(--teal-d);}
.alert.tip{background:var(--indigo-l);border-color:var(--indigo);}
.alert.tip strong{color:var(--indigo-d);}

/* ── PILL ── */
.pill{display:inline-block;border-radius:20px;padding:3px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin:2px;}
.pr{background:var(--rose-l);color:var(--rose-d);}
.pa{background:var(--amber-l);color:var(--amber-d);}
.pt{background:var(--teal-l);color:var(--teal-d);}
.pi{background:var(--indigo-l);color:var(--indigo-d);}
.ps{background:var(--sage-l);color:var(--sage-d);}
.pp{background:var(--plum-l);color:var(--plum-d);}
.pc{background:var(--coral-l);color:var(--coral-d);}
.p-red{background:#ffe5e5;color:#c0302a;}

/* ── CHAIN / PATHWAY ── */
.chain{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;}
.ch-step{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;}
.ch-left{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;}
.ch-dot{
  width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:white;flex-shrink:0;
}
.ch-line{width:2px;flex:1;min-height:20px;background:var(--border);margin:3px 0;}
.ch-body{flex:1;padding-bottom:22px;}
.ch-body h4{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px;}
.ch-body p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mid);}

/* ── TABLE ── */
.tw{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:14px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;}
thead th{background:var(--ink);color:white;padding:11px 15px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;}
tbody tr:nth-child(even){background:#fafaf7;}
tbody tr:hover{background:var(--teal-l);}
tbody td{padding:10px 15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);vertical-align:top;}

/* ── ACCORDION ── */
details{border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden;}
summary{
  padding:15px 20px;font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;
  cursor:pointer;background:white;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  list-style:none;transition:background .2s;
}
summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
summary::after{content:'＋';font-size:18px;color:var(--teal-d);}
details[open] summary::after{content:'－';}
details[open] summary{background:var(--teal-l);}
.db{padding:16px 20px;background:white;font-size:14px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.85;}
.db ul{padding-left:20px;}
.db li{margin-bottom:6px;}

/* ── CLINICAL BOX ── */
.clnbox{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--indigo-l),var(--teal-l));
  border:1.5px solid #b0c8e0;border-radius:18px;padding:24px 28px;margin:18px 0;
}
.clnbox-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.clnbox-tag{
  font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--indigo-d);background:white;padding:3px 12px;border-radius:10px;
}
.clnbox-title{font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;}
.clnbox ul{padding-left:20px;font-size:14px;}
.clnbox li{margin-bottom:7px;}

/* ── TUMOUR CARDS (big grid) ── */
.tumor-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:14px;}
.tumor-card{
  border-radius:16px;padding:20px;border:1.5px solid;
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.tumor-card::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:-24px;right:-24px;
  width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);
}
.tumor-card h4{font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;}
.tumor-card ul{padding-left:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mid);}
.tumor-card li{margin-bottom:4px;}
.tumor-badge{
  display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:3px 10px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px;
}

/* ── MICRO BOX ── */
.micro-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:12px;}
.micro-card{
  border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;border:1.5px solid;
  font-size:13.5px;
}
.micro-card h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;}
.micro-card p{color:var(--mid);}

/* ── QUIZ ── */
#quiz{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--teal-l),var(--sage-l));
  border-radius:24px;padding:40px 36px;
}
#quiz .sec-head{border-color:rgba(0,0,0,.1);}
.qprog{
  background:white;border-radius:20px;padding:12px 20px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:28px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;
}
.qbar{flex:1;height:8px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;}
.qfill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(to right,var(--teal),var(--indigo));border-radius:4px;transition:width .4s ease;}
.qcard{
  background:white;border-radius:16px;padding:26px 28px;margin-bottom:16px;
  box-shadow:0 3px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
}
.qnum{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal-d);margin-bottom:8px;}
.qtext{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.6;}
.qopts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
.qbtn{
  background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;padding:12px 18px;
  text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;
  cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;transition:all .2s;
}
.qbtn:hover{border-color:var(--teal);background:var(--teal-l);}
.qbtn.correct{background:#e8f5e9;border-color:#4caf50;color:#1b5e20;}
.qbtn.wrong{background:#ffebee;border-color:var(--danger);color:#b71c1c;}
.qbtn.reveal{background:#e8f5e9;border-color:#4caf50;color:#1b5e20;opacity:.65;}
.qletter{
  width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--border);color:var(--mid);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:12px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;transition:all .2s;
}
.qbtn.correct .qletter{background:#4caf50;color:white;}
.qbtn.wrong .qletter{background:var(--danger);color:white;}
.qbtn.reveal .qletter{background:#4caf50;color:white;}
.qexp{
  margin-top:14px;padding:13px 18px;
  background:var(--indigo-l);border-left:4px solid var(--indigo);
  border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mid);display:none;
}
.qexp.show{display:block;}
.qctrl{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.btn{
  padding:11px 24px;border:none;border-radius:10px;
  font-size:14px;font-weight:600;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;
}
.btnp{background:var(--teal-d);color:white;}
.btnp:hover{background:var(--teal);transform:translateY(-1px);}
.btns{background:white;color:var(--ink);border:2px solid var(--border);}
.btns:hover{border-color:var(--teal);}
.qresult{text-align:center;padding:36px;background:white;border-radius:16px;display:none;}
.qresult.show{display:block;}
.qscore{font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;color:var(--teal-d);}
.qlabel{font-size:16px;color:var(--mid);margin-bottom:16px;}

/* ── DISEASE TAG LIST ── */
.taglist{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;}

/* ── FOOTER ── */
footer{
  text-align:center;padding:40px 32px;
  background:var(--ink);color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);font-size:13px;
}
footer a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);}

@keyframes fadeUp{
  from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);}
  to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}
.hero-inner>*{animation:fadeUp .55s ease both;}
.hero-inner>*:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.1s;}
.hero-inner>*:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.25s;}
.hero-inner>*:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.4s;}
.hero-inner>*:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.55s;}

@media(max-width:640px){
  .hero{padding:56px 24px 48px;}
  .wrap{padding:36px 18px;}
  .topnav{padding:0 12px;}
  .grid2,.grid3,.tumor-grid,.micro-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  #quiz{padding:28px 20px;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-rings"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-kicker">Patologi Anatomi · FK UMS 2025</div>
    <h1>Patologi Sistem <em>Digestif</em></h1>
    <p>Rangkuman komprehensif dari Kelenjar Saliva → Esofagus → Gaster → Usus Halus & Kolon · Dilengkapi clinical reasoning & kuis interaktif</p>
    <div class="hero-chips">
      <span class="chip">💧 Kelenjar Saliva</span>
      <span class="chip">🔴 Esofagus</span>
      <span class="chip">🌀 Gaster</span>
      <span class="chip">🫙 Usus Halus</span>
      <span class="chip">🟩 Kolon & Anus</span>
      <span class="chip">Dr. Yuni Prastyo Kurniati, SpPA</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav class="topnav">
  <a href="#intro">📌 Intro</a>
  <a href="#saliva">💧 Sal. Saliva</a>
  <a href="#esofagus">🔴 Esofagus</a>
  <a href="#gaster">🌀 Gaster</a>
  <a href="#usus">🫙 Usus Halus</a>
  <a href="#kolon">🟩 Kolon</a>
  <a href="#anus">🩸 Anus</a>
  <a href="#perbandingan">📊 Tabel</a>
  <a href="#quiz">🧠 Quiz</a>
</nav>

<div class="wrap">

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 0. INTRO & KONSEP DASAR -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="intro">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-num">00</div>
    <div class="sec-info">
      <h2>Konsep Dasar Patologi Digestif</h2>
      <p>Tiga mekanisme utama yang mendasari semua kelainan saluran cerna</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid3">
    <div class="card ct">
      <h3>🔥 Inflamasi</h3>
      <p>Respon terhadap agen infeksius, bahan kimia, atau trauma. Contoh: sialadenitis, gastritis, esofagitis, kolitis</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card ca">
      <h3>⚠️ Degenerasi & Adaptasi</h3>
      <p>Respon sel terhadap jejas berkepanjangan: atrofi, metaplasia, hiperplasia → berpotensi displasia</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card cr">
      <h3>🔬 Neoplasma</h3>
      <p>Pertumbuhan abnormal (jinak/ganas). Di GI: umumnya adenokarsinoma (dari kelenjar), SCC (dari epitel skuamosa)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:4px;">
    <h3>🗺️ Struktur Epitel Saluran Cerna (Normal)</h3>
    <div class="tw" style="margin-top:10px;">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Segmen</th><th>Epitel</th><th>Catatan Khas</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Esofagus</td><td>Skuamosa berlapis (squamous kompleks)</td><td>Bisa metaplasia → kolumnar (Barrett)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Gaster</td><td>Kolumnar selapis (simple columnar)</td><td>Menghasilkan mukus pelindung</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Usus halus & Kolon</td><td>Epitel intestinal (+ goblet cells)</td><td>Ada villi, mikrovilli, sel goblet</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Anus bagian dalam</td><td>Epitel intestinal</td><td>Di atas linea dentata</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Anus bagian luar</td><td>Skuamosa berlapis</td><td>Di bawah linea dentata → seperti kulit</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="alert info">
    <strong>💡 Kunci Memahami GI Patologi</strong>
    Jenis epitel → menentukan jenis tumor! Mukosa skuamosa → SCC. Mukosa kolumnar/kelenjar → Adenokarsinoma. Ini mengapa adenokarsinoma paling banyak di seluruh GI tract.
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 1. KELENJAR SALIVA -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="saliva">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-num">01</div>
    <div class="sec-info">
      <h2>Patologi Kelenjar Saliva</h2>
      <p>Parotis · Sublingualis · Submandibularis — Inflamasi, Degenerasi & Neoplasma</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid2">
    <div class="card ca">
      <h3>🏛️ Anatomi Normal</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Parotis</strong> — terbesar, serus murni, Duktus Stensen</li>
        <li><strong>Sublingualis</strong> — mukus dominan</li>
        <li><strong>Submandibularis</strong> — campuran (seromukus)</li>
        <li>Semua tersusun atas asinus serus + mukus + duktus ekskresi</li>
        <li>Produksi saliva terbanyak saat mengunyah</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card ct">
      <h3>🔬 Histologi Normal</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Asinus bulat → menghasilkan sekret</li>
        <li>Duktus berkelok → menyalurkan sekret</li>
        <li>Epitel asinus: <em>serus</em> (kuboid) vs <em>mukus</em> (kolumnar)</li>
        <li>Lumen sempit, dikelilingi mioepitel</li>
        <li>Stroma fibrous antar-lobulus</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Inflamasi -->
  <h3 style="font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;font-size:18px;margin:24px 0 14px;">🔥 A. Inflamasi — Sialadenitis</h3>
  <div class="chain">
    <div class="ch-step">
      <div class="ch-left">
        <div class="ch-dot" style="background:var(--sage);">1</div>
        <div class="ch-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ch-body">
        <h4>Sialadenitis Akut</h4>
        <p>Infeksi bakteri (atau virus mumps) melalui luka kecil mukosa → infiltrasi neutrofil, edema, nyeri akut. Pembengkakan kelenjar parotis unilateral/bilateral</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ch-step">
      <div class="ch-left">
        <div class="ch-dot" style="background:var(--amber);">2</div>
        <div class="ch-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ch-body">
        <h4>Sialadenitis Kronik</h4>
        <p>Inflamasi berulang → fibrosis progresif, atrofi asinus, infiltrasi limfosit. Fungsi menurun.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ch-step">
      <div class="ch-left">
        <div class="ch-dot" style="background:var(--coral);">3</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ch-body">
        <h4>Degenerasi → Xerostomia</h4>
        <p>Lumen duktus melebar (dilatasi) → dinding menekan → sel-sel merata (flattening) → <strong>metaplasia skuamosa</strong> → pembentukan <strong>kista mukus (mukokel)</strong> → mulut kering permanen</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="alert warn">
    <strong>📌 Mukokel</strong>
    Kista retensi mukus — paling sering di bibir bawah. Terjadi akibat trauma/sumbatan duktus. Gambaran: kantong lunak berisi cairan jernih/kebiruan.
  </div>

  <!-- Neoplasma -->
  <h3 style="font-family:'Libre Baskerville',serif;font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 14px;">🔬 B. Neoplasma Kelenjar Saliva</h3>
  <div class="tumor-grid">
    <div class="tumor-card" style="background:var(--teal-l);border-color:#a8d8d0;">
      <span class="tumor-badge" style="background:var(--teal-l);color:var(--teal-d);border:1.5px solid var(--teal);">⭐ JINAK · TERSERING</span>
      <h4>Pleomorphic Adenoma</h4>
      <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;font-style:italic;">"Mixed Tumor"</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Tumor jinak kelenjar saliva tersering</li>
        <li>Paling sering di <strong>parotis</strong></li>
        <li>Proliferasi sel epitel + sel mioepitel</li>
        <li>Stroma <strong>pleomorfik</strong>: miksoid, fibrous, kondroid (bahkan bisa ada tulang rawan!)</li>
        <li>Kapsul tidak sempurna → rekurensi tinggi jika eksisi tidak lengkap</li>
        <li>⚠️ Risiko transformasi malignan <strong>5–10%</strong> → Karsinoma ex pleomorphic adenoma</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="tumor-card" style="background:var(--indigo-l);border-color:#b8c0e0;">
      <span class="tumor-badge" style="background:var(--indigo-l);color:var(--indigo-d);border:1.5px solid var(--indigo);">JINAK</span>
      <h4>Warthin Tumor</h4>
      <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;font-style:italic;">Papillary Cystadenoma Lymphomatosum</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Hampir eksklusif di <strong>parotis</strong></li>
        <li>Sering bilateral (20%)</li>
        <li>Histologi khas: epitel <strong>eosinofilik 2 lapis</strong> (onkositik) di atas stroma limfoid</li>
        <li>Gambaran "pulau-pulau" dengan stroma penuh hiperplasia limfoid</li>
        <li>Jinak, rekurensi sangat jarang</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="tumor-card" style="background:var(--rose-l);border-color:#eac0c8;">
      <span class="tumor-badge" style="background:#ffe5e5;color:#c0302a;border:1.5px solid #c0302a;">🔴 GANAS · TERSERING</span>
      <h4>Mucoepidermoid Carcinoma</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Karsinoma kelenjar saliva paling sering</li>
        <li>Tersusun atas sel mukus + sel epiteloid (skuamosa)</li>
        <li>Gradasi: low-grade (prognosis baik) → high-grade (agresif)</li>
        <li>Bisa di parotis, kelenjar minor, palatum</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="tumor-card" style="background:var(--coral-l);border-color:#e8b8a8;">
      <span class="tumor-badge" style="background:#ffe5e5;color:#c0302a;border:1.5px solid #c0302a;">🔴 GANAS</span>
      <h4>Adenoid Cystic Carcinoma</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Pertumbuhan lambat namun invasif perineural</li>
        <li>Pola histologi: kribriform ("Swiss cheese") — khas</li>
        <li>Metastasis jauh sering ke paru</li>
        <li>Rekurensi tinggi meski tampak tenang</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="clnbox">
    <div class="clnbox-h">
      <span style="font-size:22px;">🧠</span>
      <div><span class="clnbox-tag">Clinical Reasoning</span><div class="clnbox-title">Massa di Parotis — Bagaimana Pikirnya?</div></div>
    </div>
    <ul>
      <li>Massa parotis jinak, lunak, mobile → <strong>Pleomorphic Adenoma (paling sering)</strong></li>
      <li>Massa bilateral, pada perokok tua → <strong>Warthin Tumor</strong></li>
      <li>Massa keras, nyeri, pertumbuhan cepat, paresis N. VII → <strong>Karsinoma (ganas)</strong></li>
      <li>Massa rekuren pasca operasi → suspek karsinoma ex pleomorphic adenoma</li>
      <li>Semua kelenjar parotis → <strong>adenokarsinoma</strong> (karena asal dari kelenjar); bukan SCC</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

